{"steam_appid":3804370,"steam_name":"The Piper of Dawn","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3804370/446454280/3fc4a433ebd587c1d01b69f1972cfa13a08f7526/1790224564/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1790229175","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257433311/a3130b54b0a244fb7e865d96b7977cf8c428dc37/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1790229175","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804370/5d0866e7e590c5df6e108bf92016db2865c45316/ss_5d0866e7e590c5df6e108bf92016db2865c45316.1920x1080.jpg?t=1790243197","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804370/9fa7e30bc28c49feca63c58ce4ff1b29f7e97593/ss_9fa7e30bc28c49feca63c58ce4ff1b29f7e97593.1920x1080.jpg?t=1790243197","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804370/77dab8cf6e755e01b6191d8bd3eb5408fc478d95/ss_77dab8cf6e755e01b6191d8bd3eb5408fc478d95.1920x1080.jpg?t=1790243197","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804370/d7a851b245e3350d93ee1f9d399ec156b3d1a9ec/ss_d7a851b245e3350d93ee1f9d399ec156b3d1a9ec.1920x1080.jpg?t=1790243197","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804370/5f82f4b23e421faa1102588bb5933717dfb0fbef/ss_5f82f4b23e421faa1102588bb5933717dfb0fbef.1920x1080.jpg?t=1790243197"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become an alchemist in Diamond City, where growing a business means growing your own workers. Farm, craft, and sell your creations as you build relationships and navigate a dark fantasy story with multiple endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804370/extras/bffdf86840a39ed0164f68fe7282f5dd.poster.avif?t=1790243197\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804370/extras/bffdf86840a39ed0164f68fe7282f5dd.webm?t=1790243197\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804370/extras/bffdf86840a39ed0164f68fe7282f5dd.mp4?t=1790243197\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804370/extras/1e2eaa989ca90240ae2352ca83a6a151.avif?t=1790243197\" width=660 height=100 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Alchemy Business:</strong> Grow magical crops, craft valuable goods, and put your homegrown workforce to work.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet the City's Unusual Residents:</strong> Discover over 40 NPCs and relationship paths for six central heroines.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shape the City's Fate:</strong> Earn the trust of six factions and explore branching stories shaped by your choices and reputation.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804370/extras/011b669f8366bc09dd893f7d6b4e5ef7.poster.avif?t=1790243197\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804370/extras/011b669f8366bc09dd893f7d6b4e5ef7.webm?t=1790243197\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804370/extras/011b669f8366bc09dd893f7d6b4e5ef7.mp4?t=1790243197\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804370/extras/5b5d5c5d9e2a40062535bf9894dcfe57.avif?t=1790243197\" width=660 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow ingredients, turn them into valuable creations, and sell them to fund your next expansion. Along the way, fulfill orders, build relationships, and uncover the city's stranger side.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cultivate the Extraordinary</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow over 100 crops and experiment with traits to improve your harvests. Expand underground and use alchemical circles to build a flourishing, self-sustaining farm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804370/extras/3c339c5e655ac54f8c503df4797adf70.poster.avif?t=1790243197\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804370/extras/3c339c5e655ac54f8c503df4797adf70.webm?t=1790243197\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804370/extras/3c339c5e655ac54f8c503df4797adf70.mp4?t=1790243197\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Turn Curiosities into Profit</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate your shop and stock its shelves with crops, potions, and rare curiosities. Build your reputation to attract non-human customers and unlock lucrative special orders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804370/extras/8a2a97dc7947363a5c178fab7c77b604.poster.avif?t=1790243197\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804370/extras/8a2a97dc7947363a5c178fab7c77b604.webm?t=1790243197\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804370/extras/8a2a97dc7947363a5c178fab7c77b604.mp4?t=1790243197\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Grow Your Own Workforce</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet the Peoplesprouts: workers you grow yourself. Assign them to farming, retail, and manufacturing to automate your business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Match their talents to the job—and give them time to recover. Overwork takes a toll on their Sanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804370/extras/af424766bec56b6d5eefbcae1793d2d8.poster.avif?t=1790243197\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804370/extras/af424766bec56b6d5eefbcae1793d2d8.webm?t=1790243197\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804370/extras/af424766bec56b6d5eefbcae1793d2d8.mp4?t=1790243197\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Turn Experiments into Opportunity</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transform materials into valuable goods or grant your Peoplesprouts powerful abilities. Experiment with volatile elements and combine alchemy with Oracles to discover extraordinary results.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804370/extras/7db586a98b8b814f4a7ce63c4d4339df.poster.avif?t=1790243197\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804370/extras/7db586a98b8b814f4a7ce63c4d4339df.webm?t=1790243197\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804370/extras/7db586a98b8b814f4a7ce63c4d4339df.mp4?t=1790243197\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Borrow the Power of Ancient Gods</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and combine divine blessings for powerful bonuses during each time rewind. Just beware of the gods behind them—and the influence of their whispers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804370/extras/06b1886529e570055aa62cdf0f3b2726.avif?t=1790243197\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804370/extras_big/06b1886529e570055aa62cdf0f3b2726.webp?t=1790243197 width=1560 height=869 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Decide Who to Trust</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win the favor of six rival factions to unlock special orders and new story possibilities. Your reputation and choices help determine how Diamond City's story ends.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804370/extras/f26cd83f7a6030320a2009d5763f2a30.avif?t=1790243197\" width=660 height=100 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Oracle Summons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try your luck summoning blessings from Ancient and Outer Gods. Their gifts could be just what your next experiment needs.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Golden Cage Card Parlor</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge the city's residents to Blackjack. When luck fails, remember your two favorite gods: Save and Load.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804370/extras/abfd44d40ea866ad84ec2a504f39cd2f.poster.avif?t=1790243197\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804370/extras/abfd44d40ea866ad84ec2a504f39cd2f.webm?t=1790243197\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804370/extras/abfd44d40ea866ad84ec2a504f39cd2f.mp4?t=1790243197\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fishing</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cast your line across Diamond City and reel in fish, strange surprises—even an Ancient God.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804370/extras/2f7e305d0757fe7d21928a8e75d52a30.poster.avif?t=1790243197\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804370/extras/2f7e305d0757fe7d21928a8e75d52a30.webm?t=1790243197\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804370/extras/2f7e305d0757fe7d21928a8e75d52a30.mp4?t=1790243197\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804370/extras/992814b03ed0304de798396d5201d053.avif?t=1790243197\" width=660 height=100 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Sissi</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A barmaid blessed with superhuman strength—and your very first full-time hire. She originally dreamed of becoming a housemaid, only to discover a surprising natural talent for farming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804370/extras/5ccba2ec2e08ba368b73c1d6c7e2237d.avif?t=1790243197\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804370/extras_big/5ccba2ec2e08ba368b73c1d6c7e2237d.avif?t=1790243197 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Nene</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The daughter of a mathematician, Nene has a brilliant mind, razor-sharp intuition, and the combat skills to back them up. But her true talent shines through in the end: after becoming a Peoplesprout keeper, Nene finally found the perfect place to put her skills to use.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804370/extras/616750f51287ae43876615f456b6bda5.avif?t=1790243197\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804370/extras_big/616750f51287ae43876615f456b6bda5.avif?t=1790243197 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gretel</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel like adventuring alone is far too safe? Then bring this amazing trouble magnet along! She'll bring a never-ending stream of danger your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With shimmering rose-gold fur, a fluffy tail, and incredible marksmanship, Gretel seems to encounter mysterious incidents wherever she goes, recording each one in her Field Notes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804370/extras/a17c1b4aed6c8fafe4371fbde081b2bb.avif?t=1790243197\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804370/extras_big/a17c1b4aed6c8fafe4371fbde081b2bb.avif?t=1790243197 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Jimo Li</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meow? Meow, meow!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804370/extras/968b364e6012b1340441e642db98eb66.avif?t=1790243197\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804370/extras_big/968b364e6012b1340441e642db98eb66.avif?t=1790243197 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Aurora Ludwig</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Princess, goddess, sacrifice... Aurora bears many identities and possesses extraordinary magical power that greatly influences Diamond City itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A woman shrouded in mystery, her true nature remains impossible to discern.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804370/extras/aeb8169335e6a050cce2e94293d03ff5.avif?t=1790243197\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804370/extras_big/aeb8169335e6a050cce2e94293d03ff5.avif?t=1790243197 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>？？？？？</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[FILE CLASSIFIED] ///// EXTREME DANGER /////</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804370/extras/352b8eca3aa2ba9d5a145c4675c2e6a4.avif?t=1790243197\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804370/extras_big/352b8eca3aa2ba9d5a145c4675c2e6a4.avif?t=1790243197 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About Bone Nail Studio</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bone Nail Studio is a team of passionate game developers (and cat lovers) dedicated to creating fun and engaging games. We strive for quality in everything we do, though we occasionally go a little off the rails. This is our fourth game and the official sequel to Yog-Sothoth's Yard. Anyway, we hope you enjoy exploring the world we've created!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you all for your continued support!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >—Bone Nail Studio</p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5 Quad-Core<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 750 Ti<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>","genres":["Indie","RPG","Simulation","Strategy"],"developers":["Bone Nail"],"publishers":["Bone Nail","2P Games"],"release_date":"22 Sep, 2026"}